          deckDescription: 'A standard 52-card French deck; no jokers. Pisti is a Turkish fishing game for two: four cards each, four to the table; play to capture by matching rank or with Jacks; pisti (capturing with same rank) scores bonus.',
          suitDescription: 'The four French suits (hearts, diamonds, clubs, spades) each have thirteen cards. In Pisti, suit is often irrelevant for capture; matching the rank of the table card captures the pile; Jacks capture the table.',
          rankDescription: 'Standard ranks Ace through King; in Pisti, playing a card of the same rank as the top table card captures the pile. Jacks capture any table; point cards (Ace, 10, J, Q, K) score; majority of cards may score.',
